    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Galvin Property are delighted to present Apartment 1, Clearwater Court North to the market. This spacious three-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment extends to approximately 80 sq. m / 861 sq. ft and is ideally positioned within the popular Royal Canal Park development in Ashtown. The property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and benefits from excellent natural light, with large windows serving the principal living areas and bedrooms. A particular feature is the generous private outdoor terrace, providing a substantial external space rarely found with apartment living.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall leading to a bright and spacious open-plan living/dining room and kitchen. The living area features timber flooring and extensive glazing, while the adjoining kitchen is fitted with a good range of floor and wall-mounted units, integrated oven and hob and ample countertop and storage space. There are three bedrooms, all well proportioned, with fitted wardrobes providing useful storage. The principal bedroom is particularly spacious and benefits from its own en-suite shower room. A separate main bathroom, complete with bath, WC and wash-hand basin, serves the remaining accommodation. The property would benefit from some cosmetic updating, giving the new owner an excellent opportunity to put their own stamp on the apartment while retaining a particularly practical and spacious layout. Externally, the apartment enjoys the benefit of a large private paved terrace, bordered by established planting and fencing. The terrace offers excellent scope for outdoor seating, dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nRoyal Canal Park is a well-established residential development with a wide selection of amenities available locally, including supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, childcare facilities and schools. Rathborne Village is also within easy reach and provides further shops and services. Transport links are a particular advantage. Pelletstown Station serves Royal Canal Park and is on the Dublin–Maynooth/M3 Parkway rail line, providing convenient access towards the city centre. Broombridge also provides access to rail and the Luas Green Line, while the Royal Canal Greenway offers an excellent walking and cycling route. The area also enjoys convenient road access to the M50 and the wider Dublin road network."
      },
      {
